{
  "id": "twilight-masquerade-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Twilight Masquerade Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Twilight Masquerade prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 11–12 and 18–19 May 2024, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program. Each box held four Twilight Masquerade booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Twilight Masquerade logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Infernape, Froslass, Munkidori, Fezandipiti and Okidogi, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
